{
  "$doc": "Design tokens for build/foundations.js under the Bricks token names of skill bricks-bem-html (references/tokens.md), without the leading --: a Figma variable `text-title` is `var(--text-title)` in Bricks (shown as code syntax in Dev Mode). Replace values with the site's own; keep the names — lib, kit and the core components use them. Figma-only helpers (frame width, column spans, 4px literals, per-style line heights) are created under figma/… by foundations.js.",
  "fonts": { "font-family": "Inter", "font-family-display": "Inter" },
  "$colors": "brand / neutrals = the Bricks Color Manager palettes (raw values; neutrals may be [hex, alpha]). theme / components / surfaces.*.tokens rows = [name, value, scope]: value = a brand / neutral name, an earlier theme / component name, or a literal \"#RRGGBB\" / [\"#RRGGBB\", alpha]; scope text | fill | stroke | fill+stroke | text+stroke | all.",
