  "$space": "space-* = the Bricks spacing scale at 1512 snapped to 4px; spaceLiterals = 4px-grid lengths the class CSS writes as literals (figma/px-N). Gaps and paddings must resolve to one of these, layout-gutter or figma/margin; section.padY becomes the variable layout-section-pad.",
